#!/usr/bin/env bash

##
# newsboat_send
# ---
# A simple bash script that uses [Newsboat](https://newsboat.org/),
# [Pandoc](https://pandoc.org), and [Mutt](http://www.mutt.org/) to
# read the [SQLite](https://sqlite.org) database generated by newsboat,
# convert it to plain text using pandoc, and then send a message to a given
# user using mutt.
